{"version": 1, "pages": [{"id": "review", "title": "Cycle 5 · All pages", "shapes": [{"id": "doc-title", "type": "text", "boundingBox": {"x": 0, "y": -900, "w": 13120, "h": 240}, "text": "<p style='font-size:40pt;text-align:left'><b>Harvest Dashboard:All pages:C5</b><br><span style='font-size:20pt'>5 screens, left → right · Desktop 1440 wide (full page) · commit 68b5716 · <a href=\"https://harvest-dashboard.netlify.app\">https://harvest-dashboard.netlify.app</a> · harvested manually (no nightly routine)</span></p>"}, {"id": "legend-box", "type": "text", "boundingBox": {"x": 0, "y": -600, "w": 2600, "h": 440}, "text": "<p style='font-size:22pt;text-align:left'><b>How to add anything</b><br>Put a sticky note INSIDE a grey frame and write what you want changed on that page of the dashboard. Harvests of this project are manual (Run harvest on the current cycle); safe requests are applied, committed and deployed. Start with <b>Do:</b> / <b>Must do</b>, <b>Try:</b> or <b>Consider:</b> to set priority (the words win over the colour); otherwise the colour counts. Purple = feedback about this board.<br><b>Stickies show your name — stay signed in.</b></p>"}, {"id": "legend-red", "type": "rectangle", "boundingBox": {"x": 2700, "y": -570, "w": 260, "h": 300}, "style": {"fill": {"type": "color", "color": "#FF8A80"}, "stroke": {"color": "#C62828", "width": 2, "style": "solid"}}, "text": "<p style='font-size:24pt;text-align:center'><b>Red</b><br>Do / Must do</p>"}, {"id": "legend-yellow", "type": "rectangle", "boundingBox": {"x": 3020, "y": -570, "w": 260, "h": 300}, "style": {"fill": {"type": "color", "color": "#FFE066"}, "stroke": {"color": "#9A7B00", "width": 2, "style": "solid"}}, "text": "<p style='font-size:24pt;text-align:center'><b>Yellow</b><br>Try</p>"}, {"id": "legend-blue", "type": "rectangle", "boundingBox": {"x": 3340, "y": -570, "w": 260, "h": 300}, "style": {"fill": {"type": "color", "color": "#A3E4FF"}, "stroke": {"color": "#1565C0", "width": 2, "style": "solid"}}, "text": "<p style='font-size:24pt;text-align:center'><b>Blue</b><br>Consider</p>"}, {"id": "legend-purple", "type": "rectangle", "boundingBox": {"x": 3660, "y": -570, "w": 260, "h": 300}, "style": {"fill": {"type": "color", "color": "#BA23F6"}, "stroke": {"color": "#7B1FA2", "width": 2, "style": "solid"}, "textColor": "#FFFFFF"}, "text": "<p style='font-size:24pt;text-align:center'><b>Purple</b><br>Board feedback</p>"}, {"id": "frame-01-home", "type": "sparkFrame", "boundingBox": {"x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 2240, "h": 5355}, "style": {"fill": {"type": "color", "color": "#F2F3F5"}, "stroke": {"color": "#F2F3F5", "width": 0, "style": "solid"}}, "title": "01-home · / · Home — all Harvest projects", "customData": [{"key": "stepKey", "value": "01-home"}, {"key": "route", "value": "/"}, {"key": "cycle", "value": "5"}]}, {"id": "shot-01-home", "type": "image", "boundingBox": {"x": 400, "y": 400, "w": 1440, "h": 1024}, "image": {"type": "image", "url": "https://harvest-dashboard.netlify.app/captures/harvest-dashboard/c5-review/01-home.png"}, "stroke": {"color": "#C9CED8", "width": 2, "style": "solid"}, "actions": [{"type": "url", "url": "https://harvest-dashboard.netlify.app/", "newWindow": true}]}, {"id": "caption-01-home", "type": "text", "boundingBox": {"x": 400, "y": 1784, "w": 1440, "h": 220}, "text": "<p style='font-size:22pt;text-align:left'><b>01-home · Home — all Harvest projects</b><br><span style='font-size:16pt'>Dark mode by default with the sun/moon toggle; project cards show name + harvest mode, 'N cycles / date', sparkline and screenshot.</span><br><span style='font-size:16pt'>Live: <a href=\"https://harvest-dashboard.netlify.app/\">https://harvest-dashboard.netlify.app/</a></span></p>"}, {"id": "changes-01-home", "type": "text", "boundingBox": {"x": 400, "y": 2044, "w": 1440, "h": 100}, "text": "<p style='font-size:18pt;text-align:left'><b>Changes in this cycle:</b> Unchanged (project cards don't show descriptions).</p>"}, {"id": "before-label-01-home", "type": 